### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = {{loginCookie.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}
@userId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### ============================================================
### HIERARCHY API
### ============================================================

### Create reporting relationship (CanManageHierarchy ≥70)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hierarchy/relationships
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{token}}

{
  "userId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "reportsToUserId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "type": "Functional",
  "priority": 1
}

### Update relationship priority
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/hierarchy/relationships/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003/priority
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{token}}

{
  "priority": 2
}

### Delete (soft) relationship
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/hierarchy/relationships/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
Cookie: {{token}}

### Get all relationships for a user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hierarchy/relationships/{{userId}}
Cookie: {{token}}

### Get direct superiors (defaults to current user if userId omitted)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hierarchy/superiors/{{userId}}
Cookie: {{token}}

### Get primary superior
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hierarchy/superiors/{{userId}}/primary
Cookie: {{token}}

### Get superiors by type
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hierarchy/superiors/{{userId}}/by-type/Functional
Cookie: {{token}}

### Get direct subordinates (optional ?type=)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hierarchy/subordinates/{{userId}}?type=Functional
Cookie: {{token}}

### Get all subordinates recursively (CTE)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hierarchy/subordinates/{{userId}}/all
Cookie: {{token}}

### Get command chain to root
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hierarchy/chain/{{userId}}
Cookie: {{token}}

### Get organization tree (primary Functional only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hierarchy/tree
Cookie: {{token}}

### Get full tree with secondary relationships
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hierarchy/tree/full
Cookie: {{token}}

### Can command check (optional ?type=)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hierarchy/can-command/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002?type=Functional
Cookie: {{token}}

### Get hierarchy level
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hierarchy/level/{{userId}}
Cookie: {{token}}

### Sync primary reports-to from Functional priority 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hierarchy/sync-primary/{{userId}}
Cookie: {{token}}
